### 1. **Total CPU Usage per Pod over 6 Hours**

```promql
sum by (pod) (
  rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{
    cluster_name="azure-eastus-st-085-np-aks-001",
    namespace="storefront-storefront-ut",
    pod=~"storefront-api-ut-.*",
    container!="", container!="POD"
  }[6h])
)
```

**Insight:** Shows which pod consumed the most CPU overall during the last 6 hours.

